{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>屯門發生燒炭事件。今日（18日）下午2時39分，警方接獲一名女子報案，指山景邨景榮樓一單位內，其父母懷疑燒炭尋短。</p><p>救援人員接報到場，發現姓張（72歲）男事主及姓謝（69歲）女事主倒臥在單位廁所內，旁邊有一盤燒過的炭，雙雙由救護車送往屯門醫院搶救，其後被證實身亡。警方於現場檢獲遺書，將案件列「送院時死亡」，交由屯門警區重案組跟進，稍後將驗屍確定死因。</p><p>據了解，兩人生前受健康問題困擾。就現場所見，大批警員帶備裝備、與便衣警員先後登樓調查；多輛警車停泊在大廈對開。</p><figure><img alt=\"多名便裝警員登樓調查。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188531223027257344459638.jpeg/ynIUMTjeSXM4N-jw8tMwTM2dvvRErXPbPMkioBnJIqA\"/><figcaption>多名便裝警員登樓調查。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大批警員趕到山景邨調查事件。(王譯揚攝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188517218665762816564130.jpeg/18r_XN3XZk-7gqL_IAytIf6hd-fxEDAgE6blRzam5Uc\"/><figcaption>大批警員趕到山景邨調查事件。(王譯揚攝)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大批警員趕到山景邨調查事件。(王譯揚攝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188517215347937280718239.jpeg/ruKTy6saTBYOvoS5N06UWx1ISbRy8Qa1HjE-xjsxPsY\"/><figcaption>大批警員趕到山景邨調查事件。(王譯揚攝)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"屯門山景邨兩人燒炭，雙雙由救護車送院搶救。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186262531635679232321875.jpeg/JNTwJMP0IHBhIMy4-eCh2GbJpVJItzWyoxkHLaMZBy0\"/><figcaption>屯門山景邨兩人燒炭，雙雙由救護車送院搶救。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為屯門山景邨。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250308/975051033455628288964527.jpeg/x9NCSFsXDHqDXtBFGDOU83oDlM75OTJ6m5t3Cpubdwo\"/><figcaption>現場為屯門山景邨。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大批警員趕到山景邨調查事件。(王譯揚攝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188517218665762816564130.jpeg/18r_XN3XZk-7gqL_IAytIf6hd-fxEDAgE6blRzam5Uc\"/><figcaption>大批警員趕到山景邨調查事件。(王譯揚攝)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大批警員趕到山景邨調查事件。(王譯揚攝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188517215347937280718239.jpeg/ruKTy6saTBYOvoS5N06UWx1ISbRy8Qa1HjE-xjsxPsY\"/><figcaption>大批警員趕到山景邨調查事件。(王譯揚攝)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大批警員趕到山景邨調查事件。(王譯揚攝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188518723388968960328069.jpeg/uKb5EQZnMpQL9hrpdgUGPxdXTgKUBvPMo3bO04Z2ztM\"/><figcaption>大批警員趕到山景邨調查事件。(王譯揚攝)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大批警員趕到山景邨調查事件。(王譯揚攝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188517218665762816564130.jpeg/18r_XN3XZk-7gqL_IAytIf6hd-fxEDAgE6blRzam5Uc\"/><figcaption>大批警員趕到山景邨調查事件。(王譯揚攝)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大批警員趕到山景邨調查事件。(王譯揚攝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188517215347937280718239.jpeg/ruKTy6saTBYOvoS5N06UWx1ISbRy8Qa1HjE-xjsxPsY\"/><figcaption>大批警員趕到山景邨調查事件。(王譯揚攝)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"屯門山景邨兩人燒炭，雙雙由救護車送院搶救。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186262531635679232321875.jpeg/JNTwJMP0IHBhIMy4-eCh2GbJpVJItzWyoxkHLaMZBy0\"/><figcaption>屯門山景邨兩人燒炭，雙雙由救護車送院搶救。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為屯門山景邨。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250308/975051033455628288964527.jpeg/x9NCSFsXDHqDXtBFGDOU83oDlM75OTJ6m5t3Cpubdwo\"/><figcaption>現場為屯門山景邨。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T14:39:33.784482+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":479,"images":12,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T07:27:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T15:57:55.476574+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T14:38:20.429843+00:00","content_hash":"d5afb4350feef865b0f589c51c89a8a3778db3584ead6e3ecb54b8fa10be4031","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}